WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.020
What's up guys!

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:01.860
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.880
So we have hit 600 000 subscribers
which is really amazing

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.020
because we only hit 500K
less than month ago.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.680
For this special episode

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.680
We are playing a wrong hand
tournament.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.400
Let's find out who wins!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.680
It's going to be me!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.560
Guess the hand.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.760
I will start.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.600
Love all, please play!

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:27.820
Oh no!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.740
My forehand technique is beautiful!

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.160
Miikka doesn't have a backhand!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.060
I just don't need it.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.420
I'm playing forehand all table.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:40.620
One - one.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.680
That wasn't even close!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.700
Great placement!

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.480
Even better than with the left hand!

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.040
Three - two.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.200
Oh no!

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:10.840
There!

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.780
That was a good one.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.300
That was a horrible serve.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.080
That was my special serve!

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.460
I'm not gonna use it again.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.200
Are you laughing at my technique?

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.860
No, no! It looks really good!

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:35.400
Thanks!

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.740
I'm just not very good, am I?

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.960
You are good but Otto is just better.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.140
Oh no!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.340
This is embarrassingly bad!

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.500
Nine - four.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.840
You push the bat like this!

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.380
A great backhand to follow up!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.300
Eleven - four to Otto!

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.980
Great match!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.300
Do you want to start?

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.880
I will let you start.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.220
I feel like I can beat anybody!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.740
Was that a push or a topspin?

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.340
I don't know what you what you call that!

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:56.960
Down.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.200
I think it touched!

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.200
Up!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.800
It was your own side.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.800
You are supposed to hit over the net.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.660
Good serve!

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.220
This is going to be a tight match.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.180
No! No backhands!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.460
Don't play backhands.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.220
It touched the table!

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.080
Really good save! The forehand.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.600
I could have taken it with my backhand but no I used forehand.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.040
How were you taking it?

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:00.980
There!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:02.040
That's a good tactic.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.000
That's the combo!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:06.160
Oh no!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.880
You are just standing there!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:33.440
It's eight - eight!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.660
It's getting close!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:40.800
How can I miss that?

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.460
Nine - eight.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.660
No!

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.460
No!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.620
That was probably the biggest point of my life!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.420
That was a good rally.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.180
Yes!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.660
You need a break after that one!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.520
Play!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:45.480
Sorry.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.680
And he gets it with the serve!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:53.780
No!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:54.480
Thanks!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.800
Thank you.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.560
Zero - zero. Emil to serve.

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.420
I have no other option
than to beat Otto.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.200
It's not the easiest obstacle.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:09.740
Sorry!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:10.660
Lucky.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.120
Not bad actually.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.020
Good placement!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.260
There was a big forehand coming.

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.100
That's the big forehand I was talking about.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.380
Otto doesn't even look like he is playing with his wrong hand.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.840
I will give you a point for that.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:42.400
Sorry!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.480
It was the edge.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.100
That was so difficult.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.340
A high one to the backhand.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:53.500
Five - one.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.880
Nothing is going in anymore!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.200
Otto is looking strong.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.880
How can I miss that?

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.120
Six - four.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.900
Look at that!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.180
What a tactic!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.420
Six - six.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.780
Good comeback.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:54.440
No!

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.200
Seven - seven.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.060
Almost!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.060
Good swing on that!

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.580
What a return!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.060
You got arrogant after the one good shot.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.660
I always do.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.020
So close!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:42.760
Almost.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.300
Nice!

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.000
I have to get a nice finish.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:13.920
So close!

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.700
I think it might have even touched.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.080
Let's check the replay.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.140
The ball was out.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.300
We checked it a few times. The ball was out.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.720
Point to Emil.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:35.980
Almost!

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.220
Oh no!

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.360
I missed it!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.320
Now I am playing safe.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.540
He just doesn't want to win it!

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.760
Now is my best serve coming.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.160
Oh no!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.260
Good fight!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.940
Let us know in the comments

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.940
what kind of tournament you want to see next.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.540
Also hit subscribe

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.340
and check out our
previous videos there.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:38.240
Until next time!

